# 한 줄 실행 녹화: 비대화형 설치 > 설치된 워크플로우 확인 > doctor 진단 (record_cli.sh 가 {{...}} 치환)

Output "{{OUTPUT_DIR}}/cli-oneshot{{SUFFIX}}.gif"
Require node

Set Shell bash
Set Width 1200
Set Height 900
Set Padding 20
{{FONT_FAMILY_LINE}}
Set FontSize 14
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set WaitTimeout 120s

Hide
Type `cd {{WORK_DIR}}/oneshot/demo-app && export PROJECTOPS_LANG={{LANG}} PS1='$ ' && npx() { shift; node {{RUNNER}} {{WORK_DIR}}/template "$@"; } && clear`
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "ls"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "npx projectops --mode full --type spring --force"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 6s

Type "ls .github/workflows"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type "npx projectops --mode doctor"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
